  "releaseNotes": "Full release notes: https://github.com/rafalka/MauiSkiaUi/blob/v1.3.0/CHANGELOG.md#130\n\nNew features\n- RunsTappedCommand (protected virtual on SkUiView, default true)\n- PressFeedback (SkUiView and SkUiCoreNode, with SkUiPressFeedback)\n- DefaultMinimumHeight (protected virtual on SkUiButton and SkUiCoreButton)\n- SkUiDisplayBinding\n- SkUiDragger and SkUiCoreDragger\n- SkUiGridSplitter and SkUiCoreGridSplitter\n- Reordering items in SkUiCollectionView",
